{"unit_id":"liaoyuqing__dsh-llm-error-retry#card-zh","repo":"liaoyuqing/dsh-llm-error-retry","commit":"33ea19b81b82ca255b01fbba2563eb6a33ab8ae6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-error-retry 是面向 DSH 网页端的模型请求恢复插件。它通过 agent/request-error 等宿主钩子匹配状态码、机器码、字段值或错误消息，按各规则休眠并重试，耗尽次数后继续交给后续处理。插件还可处理首字超时、输出截断后的自动续写，以及模型不支持多模态时的图片省略和提示注入；网页设置区可查看活动并编辑规则，配置保存在 DSH 数据目录。适合希望减少限流、短暂传输失败或输出中断所致人工重试的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-58","host.mjs:977-1030","client.js:115-125","host.mjs:775-790"]}
{"unit_id":"liaoyuqing__dsh-llm-error-retry#card-en","repo":"liaoyuqing/dsh-llm-error-retry","commit":"33ea19b81b82ca255b01fbba2563eb6a33ab8ae6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-llm-error-retry retries DSH web model requests by configurable failure rules. It also handles first-token timeouts, continues output cut off at the token limit, and addresses non-multimodal errors with image offloading and a notice. Manage rules and activity in web settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-58","host.mjs:977-1030","client.js:115-125"]}
