{"unit_id":"liaoyuqing__dsh-llm-error-retry#feature-rule-retry","repo":"liaoyuqing/dsh-llm-error-retry","commit":"33ea19b81b82ca255b01fbba2563eb6a33ab8ae6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-error-retry 的功能「按错误规则重试」：模型请求失败时匹配状态码、机器码、字段值或消息子串，按规则等待后重发；达到次数上限则将错误交给后续处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.mjs:977-1030","cordis.patch.yml:7-58"]}
