{"unit_id":"liaoyuqing__dsh-llm-error-retry#feature-continue","repo":"liaoyuqing/dsh-llm-error-retry","commit":"33ea19b81b82ca255b01fbba2563eb6a33ab8ae6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-error-retry 的功能「截断后续写」：检测模型输出达到 token 上限后，在轮次收尾处补投续写步骤，并限制连续截断续写次数。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.mjs:1090-1170","cordis.patch.yml:19-28"]}
